      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR VISION (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished second (19.64) at Bulli latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. SPRING ARROW (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (18.56) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. The form from his last run stacks up well. Cannot be left out. BIG EDDIE (8) was in the minors two back (23.51) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 7th. Can figure in the finish. SHE'S THE BEST (2) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
